Z||000000||ArchMagi||09-26-2000||12:53 AM||||Exzactly how many speakers dose a stock fiero come with? i know theres 2 4by10s in the dash? and 2 pairs of 2 in the seats.  Are there any more?<P>Thanks a ton!<P>Arch||||reg||1
Z||000001||LarryB||09-26-2000||12:58 AM||||It depends on the model year.<P>'84-'85 came with the 4x10's in the front and the pair of speakers in each seat.<P>'86-'88 had the 4x10's in the front but instead of the speakers in the seats they put a 4x6" speaker in each side pillar just inside of the rear window. <P>If the car had the performance sound option it got different 4x10" and 4x6" speakers in the same locations as the 'standard' speakers, plus a 5 1/4" ported "subwoofer" under the right side of the dash on the passenger side. <BR><p>[This message has been edited by LarryB (edited 09-26-2000).]||||reg||6
Z||000002||baldlobo||09-26-2000||04:35 PM||||I have a total of 8 speakers in my '84; 2 4X10 in the dash, 2 4X6 in behind the seats, and 2 speakers in the headrest of each seat.<P>||||reg||1
